{"id": "official:sentence:3cec1c55-47d6-4fca-bdc8-3aa9f20e0f58", "text": "你认识照片里的男人吗？", "shortMeaning": "相片里那个男人你认得吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d96c706c-b1fa-4386-9968-bbf31f5e01af", "text": "你认识画里面的男孩吗？", "shortMeaning": "画里那男孩你认得吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:42b8e430-accd-4b84-87fc-8c60a1a7835b", "text": "你认识这个女孩吗？", "shortMeaning": "这姑娘你见过、认识吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d064c364-8a26-4a44-b039-8b2ab8fcffa8", "text": "你认识那个漂亮女孩吗？", "shortMeaning": "那个好看的姑娘你认得吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49980106-0144-4b05-9882-0d107afa6ae9", "text": "你认识那个美女吗？", "shortMeaning": "那位美人你认得吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b70960b7-cab7-4427-960f-c2c3e3bf8b12", "text": "你让她开你的车了？", "shortMeaning": "你的车你让她开了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2da0fe90-f13c-4a15-891c-faef0a67f3f3", "text": "你记不记得我们认识的那一天？", "shortMeaning": "咱们相识那天你还记得吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d4df2dfc-b1db-4152-8fb6-55c292c3cbaf", "text": "你记事情的能力并不比我好多少。", "shortMeaning": "论记性，你也比我强不到哪儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:124597c4-dacf-4f1a-bda4-ccfe4da1c1a8", "text": "你记住他的电话号码没有？", "shortMeaning": "他的电话号你记住了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f3a330f0-12a9-4471-bf7b-35e498760c26", "text": "你记得了你父亲的生日吗？", "shortMeaning": "你爸的生日你想起来了吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
